WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:21.456
"It’s a good day for painting," said Mom.

2
00:00:21.457 --> 00:00:29.444
"The kitchen needs some fresh paint."

3
00:00:29.445 --> 00:00:33.239
Mom got some paint from the basement.

4
00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:37.907
She found a paint roller and a tray.

5
00:00:37.908 --> 00:00:46.068
She put a plastic sheet on the floor.

6
00:00:46.069 --> 00:00:51.278
Then she started painting the kitchen.

7
00:00:51.279 --> 00:01:00.810
Harry and Oliver ran in with a football.

8
00:01:00.811 --> 00:01:04.782
"Don't throw that in here," warned Mom.

9
00:01:04.783 --> 00:01:07.189
But the boys didn't listen.

10
00:01:07.190 --> 00:01:10.658
"Catch, Oliver!" yelled Harry.

11
00:01:10.659 --> 00:01:12.993
The football hit the wall.

12
00:01:12.994 --> 00:01:17.869
Splat! Paint went everywhere.

13
00:01:17.870 --> 00:01:29.321
"Oh no!" cried Mom.

14
00:01:29.322 --> 00:01:33.230
Mom cleaned up the paint.

15
00:01:33.231 --> 00:01:39.887
Then she started painting again.

16
00:01:39.888 --> 00:01:44.081
Aunt Judy came home from shopping.

17
00:01:44.082 --> 00:01:46.795
"Watch out!" called Mom.

18
00:01:46.796 --> 00:01:50.071
But it was too late.

19
00:01:50.072 --> 00:01:55.879
Aunt Judy bumped into the wet paint!

20
00:01:55.880 --> 00:02:05.761
"My new sweater!" said Aunt Judy.

21
00:02:05.762 --> 00:02:09.500
Mom started painting again.

22
00:02:09.501 --> 00:02:17.569
Emmy and Rover came into the kitchen.

23
00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:20.957
"Sit, Rover!" said Emmy.

24
00:02:20.958 --> 00:02:24.116
But Rover didn’t sit.

25
00:02:24.117 --> 00:02:28.258
Rover barked and ran toward Mom.

26
00:02:28.259 --> 00:02:31.243
"No, Rover!" yelled Mom.

27
00:02:31.244 --> 00:02:33.878
Rover bumped into the paint tray.

28
00:02:33.879 --> 00:02:37.275
Paint spilled all over the sheet.

29
00:02:37.276 --> 00:02:44.472
Mom sat down and sighed.

30
00:02:44.473 --> 00:02:47.539
Then she washed the paint roller.

31
00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:51.247
She put the lid on the paint can.

32
00:02:51.248 --> 00:02:56.937
Mom put everything back in the basement.

33
00:02:56.938 --> 00:03:05.178
"It's not a good day for painting," said Mom.

34
00:03:05.179 --> 00:03:20.530
"It's a good day for resting!"
